  "title": "Grilled Hawaiian Chicken",
  "description": "Grilled teriyaki chicken breasts are topped with pineapple and served with a sweet-and-spicy pineapple-soy dipping sauce in this easy Hawaiian-inspired chicken.",
  "authors": [
    "Barbara Childers"
  ],
